{"parse": {"title": "FT-09", "pageid": 55361, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-08\" title=\"FT-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-10\" title=\"FT-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A6.BB.E5.B7.A2.E7.9A.84.E8.9B.87\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"离巢的蛇\">离巢的蛇</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 离巢的蛇</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Snake in the Grass</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>嘘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>慢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>慢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>把<span class=\"color-value\"></span>脚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010109</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>要我说，这位可爱的小姐——远道而来的法国亲戚，应当由我携着！瞧瞧这漂亮的衣裳，若是再配上水晶耳坠和时髦的术杖，谁都得为她回首，对吗，亲爱的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>呃……谢谢你的热情接待，但、但玛蒂尔达肩负着重要的逛街……任务！很高兴认识你，库伯……女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>放开这个可怜人吧，库伯教授——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>还是让我带这位小姐见识一下那些从遗迹里出来的珍品，那些古老神秘学家所遗留下来的智慧比你那些徒有其表的玩意儿，美妙多了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>而且，那位“长生不死的商人”出没在新纪元集市的消息已经坐实……据说她的手上可多了不少“旧东西”，谁会不想去大饱眼福一番？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>哼！少来了，梅克卢。温妮弗雷德女士才不会理您这样散发着腐朽味儿的老古董……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场争执近在咫尺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>呵呵……我喜欢你们聊天的样子，就像两团光晕缓缓融在一起，不分彼此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两位争执的人陷入了羞耻的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>咳、咳……好了，环状水星……别揶揄我们了……你跟这位小姐要是有什么忙需要帮，直接提就是了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她像是一位随时准备慷慨解囊的富翁敞开钱包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>一扇门，梅克卢。我们需要找到你曾经所说的，那扇门的所在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的喉咙被扼住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>门……吗？抱歉，你得给我点时间回忆回忆。对了！你、你可以先带玛蒂尔达小姐到处逛逛，我一整天都在这儿，哪都不去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>瞧，我现在还在收拾这些……乱七八糟的东西——我的脑袋没法同时干两样事儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的借口并不高明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而，她们的脚边确实垒满了书籍、占卜盘……与零零散散的日用品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>这是你们的行李吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>是的……我们打算在“庆典”之前离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>我们本为了躲避宗教与政治的纠缠，寻找到一片能互不干涉的土壤，可如今那些纷扰已经如疾病传染到了这片土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>我们失去了很多朋友，很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低下了头，仿若哀悼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>我们诚心希望你们也能……尽早离开这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>可……你们怎么能这样轻易放弃赖以生存的地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我还以为……海特街的人都是像J那样顽固不化的傻大个呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>不过也是，这起码还算一件明智的事情……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>“明智”，呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她重复了一遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>不，你弄错了。我们从不属于海特街，也不属于新纪元集市，我们甚至不占有任何物品。不管到哪儿，我们也只是在上面留下短暂的足印。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>玛蒂尔达小姐，我们早已习惯了跟蒲公英一样生存，我们对纷争没有兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唔……可你们那些朋友——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“砰！”——梅克卢使劲将箱子合上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>他们有自己的命运！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>抱歉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她轻轻拉住了旁边的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>我们走吧，玛蒂尔达小姐……梅克卢女士尚有她自己的事情要完成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们转过身，融入了另一片人群之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到她们的身影再也不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>你知道你不该那么对那个女孩……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>我们都明白，你说服不了自己。我们的信条并不总是忠贞于我们的所思所想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她坐下来，握住梅克卢颤抖的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/HeadIconSmall-562201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疗愈师库伯：</div><div>去做你该做的事。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xinjiyuanjishi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唔……说好了时间，环状水星女士怎么还没回来……明明只是临时接待客人而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她朝着环状水星的帐篷走去，里面的三个影子在火光下格外显眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>等等！玛蒂尔达小姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>嗯？你也是来找环状水星女士的吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>嘘……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她恍然失色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>不，不是的……！我专程为你而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>我必须向你承认，我扯了个谎……玛蒂尔达小姐。为了解救我的朋友们，我其实……曾对那扇门进行过详密的调查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>可我不明白，这……对你来说有什么好隐瞒的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>我只是认出了你——圣洛夫基金会的人，所以觉得可以将这个交付给你……你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>我希望你能为环状水星着想，让她别涉险其中……因此才要隐瞒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她犹豫着下一句话，接着还是说出了口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>我知道她的脾性，远甚于你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>但这恐怕并不取决于我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>我当然明白……我不打算以监护人的态度去控制我的朋友，所以……我只能提出自己的希望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-626401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩梅克卢：</div><div>那么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她靠近玛蒂尔达的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>万籁寂静中，窃窃私语融入风声，几不可闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星的帐篷另一侧，赶来了另一个急匆匆的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>唔……那帐篷里有三个家伙呆着？！我就说嘛！头儿一定在这里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>不过，还有一个人……是霍利克吗？听说他也在集市打听消息……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的手正揭开帘布，却撞上了一个高大的身躯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>什么……你怎么会在这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>莱格斯的走狗！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杰洛：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被察觉的恐惧，令他慌不择路地远离了帐篷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩背向着帐篷，俯下身子，以冷冽的眼神盯着他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>裤兜里，小刀蓄势待发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但男孩并未注意到，背后帘布之上，另一只宽大的手掌正伸过来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"626112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-626112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-626112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"626112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-626112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-626112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-626112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-626112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猫眼维森：</div><div>唔……@#￥*&amp;</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_disikewuting\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_disikewuting\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_disikewuting.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜幕被隔绝于外，灯光迷离的舞厅已聚集了一众好男好女。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们贴近着彼此，暧昧的目光交织，手臂交缠又摆动——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喧闹之中，坐在吧台的女孩格格不入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唔……该怎么办呢？如果把钥匙与门的消息告诉了J，那也同样没法瞒住环状水星女士了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>根据调查员守则，现在等待基金会的支援才是最安全的方式……可万一事态恶化，更多无辜的平民将陷入危险……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>到底要不要让环状水星女士加入计划呢……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唉，而且J今晚都去哪儿了，连个人影都没冒出来，真是一个没有危机感的家伙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>待会就轮到环状水星女士上台了……我必须得在此之前决定下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她趴在桌子上，琢磨不定，两手推移着小杯子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>玛蒂尔达小姐，你看起来像是在考虑某只股票抑或某项不动产投资的风险……还请让我给你一杯热可可，帮你展展眉头，你现在可还没到皱眉头的年纪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他伸手紧了紧领带，像是一位准备邀舞的绅士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>作为海特街专业的投资与服装顾问，我曾为不少出人头地的朋友提供过帮助……你大可以向我咨询以钱生钱之道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>谢谢。唔……好吧，一向无所不知的玛蒂尔达确实遇到了一些……投资上的难题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我听说在一座魔窟里，有两袋金子，它们的重量惊人，而不管是谁都没法同时带出来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>可里面又有个吃金子的魔鬼，等得越久，落进它肚子里的金子就越多……所以我等得越久，到手的金子就越少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>可我……又不想让身边唯一的朋友在我的牵涉下，和我一同进入魔窟——呜哇，我到底在说些什么呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>请你还是把玛蒂尔达说的这些话忘掉吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩埋下了头，啜吸着热可可。一旁的顾问却严肃地扶着下颚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>……玛蒂尔达小姐，可这两袋金子并不唯你所独有，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>如果你的朋友做出抉择，那你最该做的，是收起高尚的怜悯，就像你尊重自己的抉择一样，尊重你的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>你瞧，我在年轻时也做过不少糟糕的建议……我曾让一位食不果腹的赌徒输掉了住所，也同样曾让一位父亲重新赢得了妻子与孩子——而他们不过是同一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>若你担任顾问像我这样久了，就会明白，我们的想法从不能改变他人将行的道路，将着的衣装。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>这就是为什么我爱那些站在橱窗前，衣衫褴褛，可眼中始终熠熠生辉的顾客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>即便他们身无分文——但我明白，总有一天，总有一天……他们会来取走这件属于他们的衣装。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>而我最喜欢做的，只是在那天，将那件衣服指给他们中到来的那一位——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>“瞧，它就在那儿等您。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>音乐骤然停止了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手揭开晶光粼粼的帘子，从舞厅的走廊里伸了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们出了窍般，目光齐聚，眼睛跟着她的步伐挪移。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>环状水星赤脚踏上舞台，手臂犹如鸟儿般，高举于灯下——凝滞，相片般定格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-309601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>嘘……开始了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起先——是一个音符，撞击上另一个音符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其后，音乐犹如浪潮般倾涌而来，声浪将所有人包裹在一团共振之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可没有人摇摆，亦无人赞颂或质疑，人们只是目不转睛地盯着她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手中碰杯的人们，悬置着酒杯；痴迷于电子游戏的男人，命数随着声效一条条减少——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而她的臂膀，时而如同扑展而上的羽翼般颤动，时而同泥壤深处的种子般，沿着光蜿蜒而上，破土而出——直至顶点，回归死亡般的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啪——啪啪啪……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那整齐如一的掌声不绝，盖过了喧闹，令舞厅犹如教堂般的肃穆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我不明白，他们为什么能这么着迷。她的每个动作都没有踩在节奏上……这些是毫无根据的舞蹈，我感觉——很不舒适。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>呵呵，你听过“陶醉”的意思吗？这个词来自于希腊，意即“从当下离开”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>人们已经被那些层出不穷的电视广告、吃角子老虎机、电子游戏……被这一切的一切摆弄太久……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>灵魂如果被躯体所奴役，便会产生叛逆之心——人们正是为此而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>为了见证一场不随音乐而摆动的舞蹈，为了学会不随他们眼前的“鼓点”翩翩起舞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>她理解那些在时代中诚惶诚恐的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>但她同样明白，她不是他者命运的编织者，她跟我一样，只能将选择权交还给顾客、求助者……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">先驱者：</div><div>所以她只以自己的方式，带着他们短暂远离喧嚣的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原本踮着脚尖的舞者将脚跟落地。她鞠了一躬，走下舞台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>舞厅重回喧闹，就像她从未来过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不安的灵魂再度回归于娱乐与快感的怀抱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我……明白了，看来我必须去告诉她。谢谢你，先驱者先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“哒、哒哒——”她的脚步那般轻快。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>环状水星女士竟然没有去休息室……噢，她走得这样焦急，我得快一些赶上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>哈、哈哈……嗯？她、她去哪儿了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弯腰喘息的女孩，却望见了远处熟悉的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——然而那并不是她想要的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>那是……先前出现在帐篷里的杰洛先生？哈！我就说，记忆超群的玛蒂尔达肯定没有记错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她捏起鼻子，躲在黑色的垃圾袋旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>环状水星女士肯定把什么秘密藏了起来，这位先生对她而言似乎是位特殊的客人……可如果他来自重塑之手……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>不不，不，停止你的联想，玛蒂尔达！环状水星女士是一位还算不错的朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她缩进去的肩膀，被推了推。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼皮恍惚间变得沉重，四肢变得绵软。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>什……么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>玛蒂尔达小姐，好好睡一觉吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">环状水星：</div><div>……你恐怕并不明白，这条通往“乐园”的道路，只容许我一人通过。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-09"}}